               Sort Key: toto.nivgeo_zone, toto.codgeo_zone
               Sort Method: quicksort  Memory: 55778kB
               -&gt;  CTE Scan on toto  (cost=0.00..720.98 rows=36049 width=76) (actual time=189.428..392.457 rows=330062 loops=1)
